  Description: "COMPANION / UNCOMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nThis ally has +15% critical
    chance.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three
    units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nA survivor carrying
    an afterimage of a district erased from the maps. They are more than evidence
    of a disaster. They seek other survivors to discover what each wants next.\r\nPERSONAL
    PASSIVE\nNo additional periodic personal passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies
    and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level
    unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds:
    oddity, resolve. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star
    bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
